OL,5,BLiverpool v Man Utd player ratings     
OL,6,GMauricio Pochettino's reign as         
OL,7,GManchester United manager got off to a 
OL,8,Gdismal start as his side were beaten 4-
OL,9,G0 by rivals Liverpool after playing 82 
OL,10,Gminutes with 10 men.                   
